18. IMPORTANT KAFKA CONNECT CONCEPTS

==================================================

Kafka Connect

A framework for integrating external systems with Kafka.

Source Connector

Transfers data from external systems into Kafka.

Sink Connector

Transfers data from Kafka to external systems.

Worker

Runs connectors and their tasks.

Task

Performs the actual data movement.

Converter

Converts message keys and values between data formats.

Offset

Tracks the progress of data processing.

Plugin

Provides the connector implementation.

Standalone Mode

Runs Kafka Connect using a single worker process.

Distributed Mode

Runs Kafka Connect across multiple workers.

